  string-constant
    role string-constant
    unit "not applicable"
    example "A public &str constant with a valid name and identifier-shaped value binds those exact declaration slots; writing and compilation are separate."
    defined-by relation
    definition "A public Rust string constant declaration with an exact identifier, &str type and identifier-shaped literal value."
    precondition "The complete supported declaration and complete request bind the same constant name, type, value and destination."
    effect "Returns declaration slots for a conditional authoring plan; it does not execute a write or certify compilation."
