  equality-test
    role equality-test
    unit "not applicable"
    example "A Rust test compares signed integer operands 2 and 2; source correspondence does not certify execution."
    defined-by relation
    definition "A Rust test declaration containing one equality assertion between two signed integer literal operands."
    precondition "The test identifier is valid, each operand is within signed32-bit bounds and the full source/request forms match exactly."
    effect "Binds both operands and the test name; whether the assertion passes remains a separate execution obligation."
