    role compact
    defined-by relation
    definition "The declared style selects the compatible source text rendering operation through its observed source contract; it does not invent a new shortened algorithm."
    precondition "The goal style, unique callable graph and actual imported consumer semantics bind the complete return form."
    effect "Uses that imported rendering operation under inherited conditional effects and the same accepted verification operation."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "A source-qualified optional result is absent as null or is rendered by the observed consumer; unknown structure refuses."
